The ROM_FINGERPRINTS constant in tools/minitoo_rom_check.py contains 116 bytes
extracted from this image. tests/fixtures/br28-probe-rom-regions.json contains
another 804 bytes. tests/fixtures/core-rom-regions.json contains excerpt
addresses and hashes, with no instruction bytes. The 16-byte XOR table in tools/minitoo_ram_marker.py is also from this image and is included
in the fixture's 804 bytes. Original ownership of these bytes is retained by
the upstream rightsholders.

Changes from the upstream material: selected excerpts were extracted and
represented as Python constants or JSON/text hexadecimal strings, with
project-specific addresses, hashes and explanatory metadata. The excerpted
instruction/table bytes are unchanged. The complete ROM is not bundled.

